        "textRuns": [
         {
          "value": "Anomalies: each label has a recognisable signature",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontWeight": "bold",
           "fontSize": "18pt"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "textRuns": [
         {
          "value": "A1   ",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontWeight": "bold",
           "fontSize": "11pt"
          }
         },
         {
          "value": "Fat-finger payments are far more often ≈32× or more away from the typical amount (rounded order of magnitude ≥ 2: 72.0% vs 9.7%); an exact ×10^k multiplier is not established",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontSize": "11pt"
          }
         },
         {
          "value": "   [Supported]",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontSize": "11pt",
           "fontStyle": "italic",
           "color": "#605E5C"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "textRuns": [
         {
          "value": "A2 / A2b   ",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontWeight": "bold",
           "fontSize": "11pt"
          }
         },
         {
          "value": "Duplicates come in bursts of 2–5 identical payments (same sender, payee, currency and amount) about 18 min apart; every copy is labelled; an unlabelled original before the burst is found for 9% of bursts (chance rate 9%). Same pattern for B and C senders",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontSize": "11pt"
          }
         },
         {
          "value": "   [Supported]",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontSize": "11pt",
           "fontStyle": "italic",
           "color": "#605E5C"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "textRuns": [
         {
          "value": "A3 / A4   ",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontWeight": "bold",
           "fontSize": "11pt"
          }
         },
         {
          "value": "Romance: one consumer pays the same consumer several times within a day with rising amounts. CEO: business sender, first-time payee, above-usual amount",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontSize": "11pt"
          }
         },
         {
          "value": "   [Supported]",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontSize": "11pt",
           "fontStyle": "italic",
           "color": "#605E5C"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "textRuns": [
         {
          "value": "A5 / A6 / A7   ",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontWeight": "bold",
           "fontSize": "11pt"
          }
         },
         {
          "value": "Account replacement: mechanism not recovered. CUSTOMER_RECALL (not in the appendix): no linked payment. Anomaly rates differ by segment",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontSize": "11pt"
          }
         },
         {
          "value": "   [A5 Inconclusive · A6 Confirmed · A7 Approximate]",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontSize": "11pt",
           "fontStyle": "italic",
           "color": "#605E5C"
          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "textRuns": [
         {
          "value": "Detectors   ",
          "textStyle": {
           "fontWeight": "bold",
           "fontSize": "11pt"
          }
         },
         {
          "value": "precision / recall below are in-sample and exploratory, NOT holdout performance",
